    {
      "uuid": "b222e6b5-96ab-4049-84c0-7d7b618def6a",
      "name": {
        "text": " The Basics of Shipping",
        "isTranslationKey": false
      },
      "description": {
        "text": "    Alright Bandit, I don\u0027t really need to get too deep into the basics here.\n    To sell to The Ferret Business, you need to use the TFB Shipping System. I\u0027ll give this one to you free. Just place down the Shipping System and a Ferret Dollar into the bottom center slot.\n    Now the system is ready! You can sell most items in the FOPGame Server by putting them into the same \"Sell\" slot. Many things like Dirt aren\u0027t tracked by the FOP, so we can\u0027t use those to spread the Audubon Worm.\n    FMC, or Ferret Market Calculation, is the rough \u0027price\u0027 of an item.  Every 1,000 FMC you generate equals 1 Ferret Dollar. You can pull them out of the right side of the Shipping System when you have saved up enough.",
        "isTranslationKey": false
      },
      "x": 52,
      "y": 21,
      "icon": {
        "id": "projecte:transmutation_table",
        "Count": 1
      },
      "tasks": [
        {
          "type": "CHECKBOX",
          "description": {
            "text": "Items In, Money Out",
            "isTranslationKey": false
          },
          "longDescription": {
            "text": "    For the TFB Shipping System to offer more than Ferret Dollars, you\u0027ll need to \u0027sell\u0027 it the higher tiers of Ferret Dollars (Fan of Ferret Dollars, Stack of Ferret Dollars, Bag of Ferret Dollars) to instruct it. These are made by crafting Ferret Dollars together.",
            "isTranslationKey": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "prerequisites": [
        "2f03f6e6-7c74-496e-b834-97ef6c01ea31"
      ],
      "optionlinks": [],
      "reward": [
