      "name": {
        "text": " TFB Copper Debit Card",
        "isTranslationKey": false
      },
      "description": {
        "text": "    The TFB Shipping System can only hold a certain amount of FMC.\n    To expand the capacity of the System, as well as better transfer FMC to other assistants, use of a TFB Debit Card is suggested.\n    Multiple Debit cards can be slotted into the Left side of the Shipping System.",
