      "tasks": [
        {
          "type": "CONSUME",
          "longDescription": {
            "text": "    Higher tier Debit Cards can be obtained by combining 4 of the previous tier. The Tiers are as follows : \n    Copper \u003e Iron \u003e Gold \u003e Diamond \u003e Platinum \u003e Singularity\n    Higher tiers hold much more FMC.",
