    {
      "uuid": "3ac5316e-5492-4bd2-b0de-a8b695469b91",
      "name": {
        "text": " No Shop Vouchers",
        "isTranslationKey": false
      },
      "description": {
        "text": "    Since our primary goal is to infect as much of the FOPServer infected with the Audubon Worm as possible, without you or us getting caught too early, we have to do some workarounds.\n    Normally we would have the Shipping System sell items to you, but that puts too much data through one connection. Instead, this Shop Tablet will be how you purchase items we\u0027ve carefully pulled from the FOPServer and tagged with the Worm.\n    We won\u0027t be using Shop Vouchers this time around, since we have the \u0027tiers\u0027 of Ferret Dollars (fan, stack, bag, etc)",
        "isTranslationKey": false
      },
      "x": 83,
      "y": 21,
      "icon": {
        "id": "tfb2:ferret_dollar",
        "Count": 1
      },
      "tasks": [
        {
          "type": "CHECKBOX",
          "description": {
            "text": "Cash Only",
            "isTranslationKey": false
          },
          "longDescription": {
            "text": "To progress this quest, simply mark the checkbox below.",
            "isTranslationKey": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "prerequisites": [
        "b222e6b5-96ab-4049-84c0-7d7b618def6a"
      ],
      "optionlinks": [],
      "reward": [],
      "rewardchoice": [],
      "commandrewards": []
    },
    {
      "uuid": "f72af0b5-3f55-4a4a-a722-8c856f52b381",
      "name": {
        "text": " TFB Market Chest Mk II",
        "isTranslationKey": false
      },
      "description": {
        "text": "    The original TFB Market Chest worked well enough, but could be slow if many items were piped into it at once.\n    The Mk II Market Chest improves upon the internal design, making it sell items much faster, and putting the money in a seperate area in the Inventory.\n    This speed and convenience comes at a price, as the bandwidth needed for a Mk II chests requires some expensive spellcode materials to hide it.",
        "isTranslationKey": false
      },
      "x": 213,
      "y": 69,
      "icon": {
