    {
      "uuid": "7231760f-0437-4ea4-8879-6c47b7993bbc",
      "name": {
        "text": " TFB Market Chest",
        "isTranslationKey": false
      },
      "description": {
        "text": "    The TFB Market Chest is a way for you to automate the selling of items to earn Silver Ferret Coins.\n    There are two sections of the TFB Market Chest : The \u0027Coin\u0027 Slot in the upper left, where only Silver Ferret Coins, Shop Vouchers, and Bags/Chests of Coins can be placed; then the inventory. Any items that have an FMC value and aren\u0027t the item placed in the Coin Slot, will be sold and converted to that item when it enters the inventory.",
        "isTranslationKey": false
      },
      "x": 183,
      "y": 69,
      "icon": {
        "id": "projecte:condenser_mk1",
        "Count": 1
      },
      "repeat": {
        "type": "INSTANT"
      },
      "tasks": [
        {
          "type": "CONSUME",
          "longDescription": {
            "text": "    TFB Debit Cards cannot be placed in the Market Chest inventory. To use stored FMC, you need to pull it out of your Shipping System itself.",
            "isTranslationKey": true
          },
          "items": []
        }
      ],
      "prerequisites": [
        "0a4094a0-2af7-43e5-94f9-3199b2eb5f51"
      ],
      "optionlinks": [],
      "reward": [
        {
          "id": "projecte:condenser_mk1",
          "Count": 1
        }
      ],
      "rewardchoice": [],
      "commandrewards": []
    },
    {
      "uuid": "417affdd-3858-4335-a33e-c64d04cd0d8f",
      "name": {
        "text": " Extra Shipping Systems",
        "isTranslationKey": false
      },
      "description": {
        "text": "    The TFB Shipping System is a pricey device, especially since we have to mask it\u0027s functions from the FOPServer.\n    In the event that you have lost your TFB Shipping System, you can purchase a new one.\n    If you don\u0027t have enough Ferret Dollars to purchase a new one, you can use the second to last section of this Shop Tablet to sell some specific items.",
        "isTranslationKey": false
      },
      "x": 37,
      "y": 54,
      "icon": {
        "id": "projecte:transmutation_table",
        "Count": 1
      },
      "repeat": {
        "type": "TIME",
        "days": 1,
        "hours": 0
      },
      "tasks": [
        {
          "type": "CONSUME",
          "longDescription": {
            "text": "    Buying a new one will also take time. We need about one day to rebuild the systems to keep them from being detected. Especially because we are ensuring that if one TFB Shipping System is compromised, none of the others are discovered.",
            "isTranslationKey": true
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "item": {
                "id": "tfb2:ferret_dollar",
                "Count": 1
              },
              "required": 256
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "prerequisites": [
        "0a4094a0-2af7-43e5-94f9-3199b2eb5f51"
      ],
